      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"additional breaks and rest periods\" part sounds a bit vague for a formal safety board review. They're going to dig into the actual numbers. Can you provide a more detailed breakdown of how these specific back-to-back legs incorporate these 'optimized' rest periods? I need to be able to show them on paper that the fatigue mitigation is mathematically sound and follows all the standard rest requirements.",
